<h1>Hardware Settings - Localiser Tab</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description: Localiser</b></span> tab displays details about the localiser currently connected to the PC.</p>
<p class="whs4"><img src="../images/hw_localiser.gif" width="551px" height="485px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">The tab is divided into five information sections and a button for advanced settings changes:</span></p>
<p class="sub-head">Position and Orientation sections</p>
<p>These display the orientation of the localiser and its position in mm.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Foot/Hand switches section</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">'A' and 'B'. This is a test for buttons on the foot pedals or remote switch.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Check 'Use arm buttons' to use the localiser buttons as 'A' and 'B' buttons instead of foot pedal.</p>
<p class="Note" id="p1"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: Not all localisers support this option.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Probe diameter box</p>
<p>Enter the diameter of the probe ball, which needs to be offset to get the actual dimensions.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Localiser list</p>
<p>Choose the correct co-ordinate measuring machine option from this drop down list box.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Advanced Settings and the adjoining information section</p>
<p>These are specific to the currently selected localiser.</p>
<ul>
<li style="margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-p-CClick">
<p class="Click">&#160;Here below follows a list of localisers. Click on each to see description of its advanced settings:</p>
</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><a href="hardware_settings_-_localiser_(faro_advanced_settings).htm">FARO (Bronze, Bronze Plus, Silver, Sterling, and Gold)</a></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><a href="hardware_settings_-_localiser_(faro_platinum_advanced_settings).htm">FARO USB (Platinum and Titanium)</a></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><a href="hardware_settings_-_localiser_(cimcore_advanced_settings).htm">CimCore</a></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><a href="hardware_settings_-_localiser_(Metris_MCA_advanced_settings).htm">Metris MCA</a></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="sub-head">Reset Connection</p>
<p>Click on this button to reset the connection between the localiser and the KUBE software. This option replaces the combination of choosing again the localiser from the drop-down menu and pressing the Apply button.</p>

